# Rust
target/
# Cargo.lock IS committed - this workspace has a binary
# (`treasury_demo`), so we want reproducible builds for anyone cloning.

# Proprietary anti-cheat / verification engine — NOT open source.
# The real scoring rubric, thresholds, feature extraction, ML model and
# fraud dataset live here. Present locally for the real build; excluded
# from the public (MIT) repo. The public repo ships only the open interface
# + a stub (see mobile/src/verification/), so forks build and test but do
# not get the moat. See mobile/src/verification-private/README.md.
mobile/src/verification-private/

